//
// ### SkinShop ###
//	The server reads this file, the client reads it as Data\Local\SkinShop.bmd, encrypted like CustomText.bmd; both must be the same file
//
//	DefaultCurrency: Currency of every price that names none of its own, ID of SkinShop::Currencies::Currency
//	Key: Key or key combination that opens and closes the shop window; left empty, the window has no key
//		~ Ctrl, Shift and Alt joined with + before one key, for example F5, Ctrl+K, Ctrl+Shift+F5 or Alt+5; names are not case-sensitive
//		~ The key can be A-Z, 0-9, F1-F12, N0-N9 (numeric keypad), SPACE, INSERT, DELETE, HOME, END, PRIOR (Page Up), NEXT (Page Down), LEFT, UP, RIGHT, DOWN, PAUSE
//		~ The combination must match exactly, so F5 does not open the window while Ctrl, Shift or Alt is held
//		~ A combination whose key is a letter, a digit or SPACE does nothing while the chat's text box is open, F keys still work there
//		~ F1 and F6-F12 are already taken by the DLL and Lua UI
//
// ### SkinShop::Currencies::Currency ###
//	ID: Currency type
//		~ 0: Zen
//		~ 1: WCoin
//		~ 2: Goblin Point
//		~ 3: Ruud
//
//	NameID: Currency name, shown in the balance line and in the purchase question; Msg ID in CustomText.xml, section SkinShop
//	ShortID: Short name, shown after a price when the currency has no icon; Msg ID in CustomText.xml, section SkinShop
//	Icon: 32x32 icon under Data\, a .tga path loads the .ozt; left empty, the short name is shown instead
//
// ### SkinShop::Skins::Skin ###
//	ID: Skin identification number, 1-65534; the server and the database know the skin by it, never reuse one
//	Monster: Monster index the character turns into (MonsterList.xml or a CustomMonster ID)
//	NameID: Skin name, Msg ID in the client's CustomText.xml, section SkinShop
//	SummaryID: One short line under the name in the list, the price sits beside it; Msg ID in CustomText.xml, section SkinShop
//	DescriptionID: Longer text in Skin info, Msg ID in CustomText.xml, section SkinShop
//	Currency: Overrides DefaultCurrency for every option of this skin, optional
//	Zoom: Preview size correction, float, optional
//		~ 1: as the preview frames the skin by itself (default)
//		~ above 1: closer
//		~ below 1: further away
//
// ### SkinShop::Skins::Skin::Option ###
//	One way to buy the skin, at most 5 per skin; the first one is shown in the list
//
//	Days: Duration in days, optional
//	Hours: Duration in hours, optional
//		~ Days and Hours add up; with both 0 or left out the skin is permanent
//
//	Price: Price in the option's currency
//	Currency: Overrides the skin's currency for this option only, optional
//
// STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

<SkinShop DefaultCurrency="1" Key="Ctrl+S">
